ongestion Management and Investment Deferral in Distribution Networks.”&q;,&q;place&q;:2,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;a4b921fe-ad09-455a-b7f3-2268ecf0b645&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;spa&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;[4]\tJ. M. L. Lezama, “PROPUESTAS ALTERNATIVAS PARA MANEJO DE CONGESTIÓN EN EL MERCADO DE ENERGÍA ELÉCTRICA COLOMBIANO,” 2006.&q;,&q;place&q;:3,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;3afa173b-c092-4b7a-81b6-66bbaf3fec88&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;spa&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;[5]\tS. Gope, S. Dawn, R. Mitra, A. K. Goswami, and P. K. Tiwari, “Transmission congestion relief with integration of photovoltaic power using lion optimization algorithm,” in Advances in Intelligent Systems and Computing, 2019, vol. 816, pp. 327–338, doi: 10.1007/978-981-13-1592-3_25.&q;,&q;place&q;:4,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;e2b2fd91-f262-4236-82e3-2cc25d3a060a&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;spa&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;[6]\tE. Reihani, P. Siano, and M. Genova, “A new method for peer-to-peer energy exchange in distribution grids,” Energies, vol. 13, no. 4, 2020, doi: 10.3390/en13040799.&q;,&q;place&q;:5,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;5abd89b5-e031-4bb0-9a15-91ec6c5c3a26&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;spa&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;[7]\tK. Vijayakumar, “Multiobjective optimization methods for congestion management in deregulated power systems,” J. Electr. Comput. Eng., 2012, doi: 10.1155/2012/962402.&q;,&q;place&q;:6,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;0b700eba-aade-465e-a30e-d0f802a93137&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;spa&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;[8]\tJ. M. L. LEZAMA, “UNIVERSIDAD NACIONAL DE COLOMBIA SEDE MANIZALES DEPARTAMENTO DE INGENIERÍA ELÉCTRICA, ELECTRÓNICA Y COMPUTACIÓN,” Manizalez, 2006.&q;,&q;place&q;:7,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;f06738d4-2b72-4ee5-a6b4-491399450dad&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;spa&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;[9]\tInstitute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers, IEEE Dielectrics and Electrical Insulation Society. Kolkata Chapter, IEEE Power &a; Energy Society. Kolkata Chapter, Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers. Kolkata section, and North Eastern Regional Institute of Science and Technology, 2012 1st International Conference on Power and Energy in NERIST (lCPEN) : proceedings : [held at new seminar hall of North Eastern Regional Institute of Science and Technology] : Nirjuli, Arunachal Pradesh, India : 28-29 December 2012. .&q;,&q;place&q;:8,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;7adb9f4b-f414-44d7-abd4-06f52cbc5008&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;spa&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;[10]\tJ. Hazra and A. K. Sinha, “Congestion management using multiobjective particle swarm optimization,” IEEE Trans. Power Syst., vol. 22, no. 4, pp. 1726–1734, Nov. 2007, doi: 10.1109/TPWRS.2007.907532.&q;,&q;place&q;:9,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;615d8a71-016c-4e3d-b19c-c1708dbd8f4e&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;spa&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;[11]\tI. Kalogeropoulos and H. Sarimveis, “Predictive control algorithms for congestion management in electric power distribution grids,” Appl. Math. Model., vol. 77, pp. 635–651, Jan. 2020, doi: 10.1016/j.apm.2019.07.034.&q;,&q;place&q;:10,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;c746e09d-fb10-47c6-8e58-886f6092d96d&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;spa&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;[12]\tW. Liu, Q. Wu, F. Wen, and J. Ostergaard, “Day-ahead congestion management in distribution systems through household demand response and distribution congestion prices,” IEEE Trans. Smart Grid, vol. 5, no. 6, pp. 2739–2747, 2014, doi: 10.1109/TSG.2014.2336093.&q;,&q;place&q;:11,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1},{&q;uuid&q;:&q;0cab90f2-2927-4264-bb83-9f8dbb2eaa86&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;spa&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;[13]\tM. Kashyap and S. Kansal, “Hybrid approach for congestion management using optimal placement of distributed generator,” Int. J. Ambient Energy, vol. 39, no. 2, pp. 132–142, 2018, doi: 10.1080/01430750.2016.1269676.&q;,&q;place&q;:12